WHAT THIS LICENCE COVERS

This repository is not under a single licence, and a scanner that reads only
this file will get it wrong. Three regimes apply:

  - ai-go.html AS A WHOLE, check.html, test/run.mjs, tools/typographie.mjs and
    this LICENSE file itself: the BSD 3-Clause licence below.
    SPDX-License-Identifier: BSD-3-Clause
    AS A WHOLE means every line of ai-go.html, the doctype, the
    Content-Security-Policy, the <title> and the closing tags included. It
    also, and deliberately, covers the 59 lines that lie OUTSIDE the two
    blocks inside the region from AI_GO-BEGIN to AI_GO-END, which is the
    region docs/INTEGRATE.md tells you to paste into a CMS: the header
    comment, the <script> tags around the content, the <main> wrapper, the
    <h1>, the standfirst, the container <div>, the author <style> and the
    closing markers. Naming only the two blocks left that region conceded by
    nobody.
  - The content block of ai-go.html, the tree format it demonstrates and
    docs/DEMARRER.md, which is that same form left blank, are offered under
    CC0-1.0 as well: take them that way and you owe nothing, not even the
    notice. Where the two regimes overlap, you choose.
  - reference/aigo-unil.js, reference/aigo-unil.paths.js, docs/ARBRE.md and
    docs/capture.png, that is the questionnaire content of the University of
    Lausanne: ALL RIGHTS RESERVED. Published for reference, not licensed for
    reuse. Read docs/INTEGRATE.md for why copying it would be dangerous
    rather than merely forbidden.

  - Everything else in this repository, that is README.md, CHANGELOG.md,
    CONTRIBUTING.md, SECURITY.md, CITATION.cff, docs/DEMARRER.md,
    docs/INTEGRATE.md, docs/PUBLICATIONS.md, .gitignore
    and .github/workflows/test.yml: the BSD 3-Clause licence below as well.
    docs/DEMARRER.md is named twice on purpose: it is under both, and the
    "as well" above only means something if it is. Take it either way.

CONDITION 1 APPLIES TO EVERY FILE ABOVE, ONE BY ONE

Clause 1 asks that the copyright notice, the conditions and the disclaimer be
retained in redistributions of source. A single file taken out of this
repository carries a short notice naming this licence, and this file is what
that notice points to: SHIP THIS FILE WITH THEM. The two integration paths in
docs/INTEGRATE.md, the standalone upload and the block pasted into a CMS, both
distribute ai-go.html; put LICENSE beside it, or the warranty disclaimer that
protects both you and the copyright holder does not travel with the code.

